3Y = {prio:1} 13+ hcp
2Y = 0--12 hcp

After opener's partner makes a negative double, advancer bids as if it had been a pass
(the double does not change what the raises, the cuebid and notrump show), so the cuebid
needs a fit and game interest here too; without one of these calls advancer passes
(NOTES.md P9).

