Over a minor-suit Michaels cuebid (both majors), advancer must choose a major:
game with 13+, a jump with 11--12, and otherwise the cheaper call, spades with
spade length and a doubleton or less in hearts, hearts with everything else
(the booklet only states that advancer picks the suit; the ranges are this
file's). A 13+ hand with a doubleton or less in both majors bids 3NT.

